// Morale Modifier Table (rules §17.4) — DATA.
// Human-readable companion: docs/source-materials/morale-modifier-table.md
//
// Inverted table keyed by Disorganization Level (rows, high→low: +8+ down to -17-).
// Within a row, find which printed dice range [min,max] (straight two-dice read,
// 11..66) contains the roll → the morale modifier for that combat.
// Entry = (min, max, outcome). Outcome: Delta(n) (NO = Delta(0)) or Surrender.
(
    rows: [
        [(11, 26, Delta(4)), (31, 46, Delta(3)), (51, 65, Delta(2)), (66, 66, Delta(1))],                     // +8+
